28:["$","div","Taking good document photos",{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-lg font-semibold","children":"Taking good document photos"}],[["$","p","Place the document on a flat, dark surface in go",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"Place the document on a flat, dark surface in good daylight and hold the phone directly above it so that the page is not skewed. Avoid shadows and flash glare. Use your phone’s document scan mode if it has one; it straightens and sharpens the page automatically."}],["$","p","Keep the full document in the frame, including a",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"Keep the full document in the frame, including all edges, signatures and stamps. A clear, evenly lit photo converts into a clean PDF and is less likely to be rejected."}]],null,null]}]
29:["$","div","Keeping the PDF small enough to upload",{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-lg font-semibold","children":"Keeping the PDF small enough to upload"}],[["$","p","Photos from modern phones can be several MB each",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"Photos from modern phones can be several MB each, and a PDF of many photos quickly grows past a portal’s upload limit. Resize or compress images before converting, scan at moderate quality and use the compress PDF tool afterwards if needed."}],["$","p","For forms that ask for a single PDF with several",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"For forms that ask for a single PDF with several documents, convert all the images in one go in the correct order, then check the file’s size."}]],["$","ul",null,{"className":"list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5 text-sm text-muted-foreground","children":[["$","li","Convert all pages together in the right order",{"children":"Convert all pages together in the right order"}],["$","li","Compress the PDF if the portal has a small limit",{"children":"Compress the PDF if the portal has a small limit"}],["$","li","Name the file with your name and the document type",{"children":"Name the file with your name and the document type"}]]}],null]}]
2a:["$","div","Step-by-step: from phone photo to a clean PDF",{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-lg font-semibold","children":"Step-by-step: from phone photo to a clean PDF"}],[["$","p","First, photograph or scan every page and delete ",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"First, photograph or scan every page and delete blurred or duplicate shots. Second, rotate any sideways photo in your gallery app so it is upright. Third, crop each page so that only the document is visible. Fourth, add the images to the tool in the order you want the pages to appear. Finally, press “Create PDF & download” and open the file once to check the order, orientation and readability."}],["$","p","If a page is in the wrong place, clear the list ",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"If a page is in the wrong place, clear the list and add the images again in the correct order. It takes a minute and is safer than trying to fix the order afterwards."}]],["$","ul",null,{"className":"list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5 text-sm text-muted-foreground","children":[["$","li","Delete blurry and duplicate photos before you start",{"children":"Delete blurry and duplicate photos before you start"}],["$","li","Rotate and crop in your gallery app",{"children":"Rotate and crop in your gallery app"}],["$","li","Add pages in order, convert and check the result",{"children":"Add pages in order, convert and check the result"}]]}],null]}]
2b:["$","div","Which documents people convert",{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-lg font-semibold","children":"Which documents people convert"}],[["$","p","Typical uses include identity and address proofs",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"Typical uses include identity and address proofs for KYC, mark sheets and certificates for admissions and job applications, handwritten assignments, receipts for reimbursement claims, medical reports for insurance and signed forms. Each of these usually has a size limit and a file-type rule on the portal, so read the instructions on the upload page before you start."}],["$","p","Portals commonly limit files to somewhere betwee",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"Portals commonly limit files to somewhere between a few hundred kilobytes and a few megabytes, so check the exact limit shown by the portal and compress the PDF if needed. Never edit or retouch an identity document; submit a clear, honest image of the original."}]],null,null]}]
2c:["$","div","Fixing common problems",{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-lg font-semibold","children":"Fixing common problems"}],[["$","p","If text looks blurry, retake the photo in better",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"If text looks blurry, retake the photo in better light and hold the phone steady. If pages appear sideways, rotate the original images and convert again. If the file is too large, crop out empty margins, lower the camera or scanner resolution slightly and run the finished PDF through the compress tool. If a photo does not appear in the list, check the format: iPhone photos saved as HEIC should be shared as JPG or captured in the “Most Compatible” setting, because this tool accepts only JPG and PNG."}]],["$","ul",null,{"className":"list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5 text-sm text-muted-foreground","children":[["$","li","Blurry text: retake in daylight, no flash",{"children":"Blurry text: retake in daylight, no flash"}],["$","li","Wrong direction: rotate the original image first",{"children":"Wrong direction: rotate the original image first"}],["$","li","HEIC photo: switch the camera to JPG or export as JPG",{"children":"HEIC photo: switch the camera to JPG or export as JPG"}],["$","li","Too large: crop, reduce resolution and compress the PDF",{"children":"Too large: crop, reduce resolution and compress the PDF"}]]}],null]}]
2d:["$","div","Privacy",{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-lg font-semibold","children":"Privacy"}],[["$","p","Images are processed on your device. They are no",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base","children":"Images are processed on your device. They are not sent to ContentVerse India servers, so ID proofs and certificates remain private. Delete the generated PDF when you are done if it contains sensitive information."}]],null,null]}]
